<title>BELGIUM: Belgian OLO exchange auction totals 12.21 bln bfr.</title>
<headline>Belgian OLO exchange auction totals 12.21 bln bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury said its linear government bond (OLO) exchange auction totalled 12.21 billion Belgian francs.</p>
<p> OLOs offered *		 amount of new OLOs sold (in bln bfr)</p>
<p> code 287 4.00% (2000)	3.85</p>
<p> code 259 8.75% (2002)	5.50</p>
<p> code 275 7.75% (2004)	0.50</p>
<p> code 286 6.25% (2007)	2.36</p>
<p>NOTE - * in exchange for 10.93 bln bfr of OLO 254 9.25% (1997) and 1.28 bln bfr of OLO 248 9.25% (1998)</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
